CORE
regular_sequence_monitor.sv
--bound 8 --undriven seq
^main\.ordered: finite bad frame 4
^main\.empty_tail_o: finite bad frame 1
^main\.empty_tail_n: finite bad frame 2
^main\.two_delays: finite bad frame 4
^main\.past_bad: finite bad frame 4
^\[main\.reversed\] .*: PROVED up to bound 8$
^\[main\.reset_gap\] .*: PROVED up to bound 8$
^\[main\.past_good\] .*: PROVED up to bound 8$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
Check consecutive stars, optional tails, multiple delay endpoints, reset on
a delay tick, and past sampling in native BMC.
